			"id": "102",
			"headline": "Tech Company Releases 'Honest Smart Home' That Refuses To Lie About Energy Usage",
			"summary": "The 'TruthHome' system announces to guests 'We used 47% more electricity than necessary because efficiency is for suckers.'",
			"fullBody": "EcoInnovate Corp has released the 'TruthHome' smart home system that refuses to hide the truth about your energy consumption. The system uses AI to analyze your electricity usage and delivers honest announcements like 'You've left 7 lights on in rooms you're not in, your ancestors are weeping' and 'The AC is running while the window is open, you're basically burning money for the environment.' The system also announces to guests 'Welcome to our home, we use 47% more energy than necessary, please don't judge us.' One homeowner said, 'I was having a dinner party and the system announced --You've microwaved that cup of water 12 times today, just drink it cold next time.-- My guests never looked at me the same way.' The system has been praised for 'honesty that borders on psychological warfare.'",
