			"id": "106",
			"headline": "Company Creates 'Honest Performance Review Bot' That Says Exactly What Your Manager Is Thinking",
			"summary": "The 'StraightTalkAI' outputs things like 'You're not a bad employee, but you're also not a memorable one, which might be worse.'",
			"fullBody": "Corporate honesty advocates TruthAtWork Inc. have created the 'StraightTalkAI,' a bot that delivers honest performance reviews based on your actual workplace behavior. The AI analyzes your emails, meeting attendance, and productivity data to deliver unfiltered assessments like 'You show up on time, but you're always the first to leave, and your colleagues have noticed' and 'Your ideas are fine, but you present them in meetings like you're apologizing for taking up space.' One employee received a review that said 'You're the human equivalent of a 'good job' from a parent who never had anything specific to praise. Try being more memorable.' HR has received 300 complaints, with one employee saying 'I asked for feedback and got a therapy session instead.' The company is now offering 'Honest Feedback Fridays' where the AI delivers your coworkers' unspoken opinions.",
