			"id": "110",
			"headline": "New Social Network 'NoOneKnows' Has Zero Users But 100% Genuine Connections",
			"summary": "The platform only works if no one joins it, making it the most honest and least popular network ever created.",
			"fullBody": "Anti-social social network 'NoOneKnows' has launched with the unique feature that it only works when absolutely no one uses it. The platform is designed for people who want genuine connection but are tired of dealing with the complications of other people knowing about their existence. The app's terms of service state 'If you join this platform, it will stop working. Please do not join. Tell your friends not to join. This is a community for people who are not here.' One user said, 'I joined the platform and immediately the servers crashed. I felt seen and also immediately regretted my decision.' The app has 0 active users and is described as 'the most honest social network ever created' and 'the most confusing app to market.' The company is considering pivoting to a support group for people who want to be social but also don't want to be social.",
